    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping away... you mean leaving the family? or something more permanent? i just keep thinking that if i wasn't in the picture at all, the shame would finally end. they could just go back to being what they were meant to be. maybe it's the only way to actually give them their honor back.",
